# A134: se_sketch close names the dimensions it adds after what they size (Sketch_1_Width...), places a sketch from model edges brought in with project (they follow the model) and first from the lines given in 'elements'. Each part is closed without saving.
# A: 40x20 rectangle at (10,5): Sketch_1_Width 40, Sketch_1_Height 20, Sketch_1_X 10 and Sketch_1_Y 5; V = 8000. C: only two edges of its bottom face projected leave their other ends free: close refuses the sketch and takes back what it added. B: a r3 circle at (40,15) on the xy plane with the 4 edges of the bottom face (z = 0) projected and made construction (references, not profile): their ends meet at the corners and the circle is placed from them (10 from the right edge, 10 from the bottom or top one): 3 dimensions (the sketch is Sketch_3: Sketch_2 was C), Sketch_3_Diameter 6, Sketch_3_X 10, Sketch_3_Y 10; cut through: 8000 - pi*9*10 = 7717.257. Driving Sketch_1_Width to 60 moves the right edge to x = 70 and the hole with it (x 57-63): +4000
@dA = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
@kA = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
se_sketch {"action":"rectangle","sketch":"{{kA.sketch}}","points":[10,5,50,25]}
@cA = se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{kA.sketch}}"}
?= cA.fullyDefined true
?= cA.defined.dimensions[0].variable Sketch_1_Width
?= cA.defined.dimensions[1].variable Sketch_1_Height
@gAx = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Sketch_1_X"}
?= gAx.value 10
@gAy = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Sketch_1_Y"}
?= gAy.value 5
@xA = se_extrude {"sketch":"{{kA.sketch}}","distance":10}
?= xA.volume 8000
@fB = se_geometry {"action":"faces","direction":[0,0,-1]}
@eB = se_geometry {"action":"edges","source":"{{fB.items[0].handle}}"}
@kC = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
se_sketch {"action":"project","sketch":"{{kC.sketch}}","elements":["{{eB.items[0].handle}}","{{eB.items[1].handle}}"]}
se_sketch {"action":"circle","sketch":"{{kC.sketch}}","center":[30,15],"radius":2}
! [sketch_under_defined] se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{kC.sketch}}"}
@iC = se_sketch {"action":"info","sketch":"{{kC.sketch}}"}
?= iC.fullyDefined false
se_sketch {"action":"delete","sketch":"{{kC.sketch}}"}
@kB = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
@pB = se_sketch {"action":"project","sketch":"{{kB.sketch}}","elements":["{{eB.items[0].handle}}","{{eB.items[1].handle}}","{{eB.items[2].handle}}","{{eB.items[3].handle}}"]}
se_sketch_edit {"action":"construction","sketch":"{{kB.sketch}}","elements":["{{pB.elements[0].element}}","{{pB.elements[1].element}}","{{pB.elements[2].element}}","{{pB.elements[3].element}}"]}
se_sketch {"action":"circle","sketch":"{{kB.sketch}}","center":[40,15],"radius":3}
@cB = se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{kB.sketch}}"}
?= cB.fullyDefined true
?= cB.elements.dimensions 3
?= cB.defined.dimensions[0].variable Sketch_3_Diameter
@gBx = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Sketch_3_X"}
?= gBx.value 10
@gBy = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Sketch_3_Y"}
?= gBy.value 10
@xB = se_extrude {"sketch":"{{kB.sketch}}","operation":"cut","extent":"through_all"}
?= xB.volume 7717.257 0.01
@sB = se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Sketch_1_Width","value":60}
?= sB.volumeChange 4000 0.01
@hB = se_geometry {"action":"faces","type":"cylinder"}
?= hB.items[0].boundingBox.min[0] 57 0.001
?= hB.items[0].boundingBox.max[0] 63 0.001
se_documents {"action":"close","document":"{{dA.handle}}","saveChanges":false}
# D: 60x40 plate at the origin with a construction datum line x = 20 and a r5 circle at (35,20); close with elements = [datum] places the circle from it (15) instead of from the right edge (25): Sketch_1_Width 60, Sketch_1_Height 40, Sketch_1_Diameter 10, Sketch_1_X 20 (the datum), Sketch_1_X2 15, Sketch_1_Y 20. V = (2400 - 25 pi) * 10 = 23214.602. Driving the datum to 30 moves the hole to x = 45 (40-50)
@dD = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
@kD = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
se_sketch {"action":"rectangle","sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","points":[0,0,60,40]}
@lD = se_sketch {"action":"line","sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","points":[20,0,20,40]}
se_sketch_edit {"action":"construction","sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","elements":["{{lD.element}}"]}
@oD = se_sketch {"action":"circle","sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","center":[35,20],"radius":5}
! [invalid_argument] se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","elements":["{{oD.element}}"]}
@cD = se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","elements":["{{lD.element}}"]}
?= cD.fullyDefined true
?= cD.elements.dimensions 6
@gDx = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Sketch_1_X2"}
?= gDx.value 15
@gDy = se_variables {"action":"get","name":"Sketch_1_Y"}
?= gDy.value 20
@xD = se_extrude {"sketch":"{{kD.sketch}}","distance":10}
?= xD.volume 23214.602 0.01
@sD = se_variables {"action":"set","name":"Sketch_1_X","value":30}
?= sD.volumeChange 0 0.01
@hD = se_geometry {"action":"faces","type":"cylinder"}
?= hD.items[0].boundingBox.min[0] 40 0.001
se_documents {"action":"close","document":"{{dD.handle}}","saveChanges":false}
